  "sourceAudit": {
    "implementation": "native-lower-return-fairing@2",
    "system": "For each mouth-up/front coordinate independently: (D+L) delta = -L x, with D_i=degree_i/(length^2*gain_i) and positive rest-edge weights 1/restLength^2.",
    "meaning": "当前能量折中原位置保持与邻接坐标差异。外围保护不能防止自由 crest 降低或肩部收缩；crest 当前被记录但没有固定。",
    "preservedArchitecture": [
      "Complete original skin index/rest graph and lower-versus-upper carrier distances.",
      "Existing body/contact one-ring, all non-skin and zero-rest collars fixed.",
      "0.6mm entire-proposal rejection, finite/convergence and local area/orientation checks before writes.",
      "Original mouth-x correction zero before Float32 storage; jaw gate and full inherited microgeometry/normal stages retained."
    ],
    "semanticSource": "Original R06 sets l19Oral from membership in headTransfer.d.oral_skin_ids, interpolated by canonical.gnmRecipes. This is authored native semantics, not a measured anatomical mucosa length/thickness boundary.",
    "semanticSourceExcerpt": "l[n.bodyCount+p]=(c.has(h)?1-d:0)+(c.has(u)?d:0)",
    "engineeringNotPhysiology": true
